	<#bbbbbb>This move list assumes you are facing to the right.</>

	<#7f7f7f>UNIQUE TRAIT: FREE AS THE WIND</>
	Excluding a few exceptions, Arzon can freely cancel Special Moves
	and Remix Moves into other Special and Remix Moves up to
	3 times in a sequence, so long as he doesn't try to use
	any specific move more than once in that sequence.

	<#7f7f7f>UNIQUE MOVES</>
STORM WINDS	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</> _DF^C
TYPHOON WAVE	-		_D(HOLD)^C












_D	_D		_D

	<#7f7f7f>SPECIAL MOVES</>
TYPHOON SHOT	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</> ^Y
_!TYPHOON FOLLOWUP	-		^Y
TYPHOON DISK		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</> _F^Y
TORNADO TRAP	-		_B^Y
   <#bbbbbb>Places a trap at the enemy's current location.</>
_!TYPHOON UPPERCUT	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</> _B^Y
   <#bbbbbb>Can be jump canceled on hit.</>
TYPHOON SHIELD	-		_D^Y
   <#bbbbbb>A large move that gains invincibility after it begins.</>
WHIRLWIND HOVER	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)</> _D^Y
   <#bbbbbb>This move stops Arzon's vertical movement, allowing
   him to hover and drift side-to-side for a moment.
   This move does not obey Arzon's FREE AS THE WIND trait.</>








_D	_D		_D

	<#7f7f7f>REMIX MOVES</>
JETSTREAM	-		^Z/_F^Z/_B^Z/_D^Z
   <#bbbbbb>Creates a gust of wind that manipulates Arzon's projectiles.
   Can also move enemies during a combo.</>


















_D	_D		_D

	<#ffef0f>EX MOVES</>
_EX WIND BOOMERANG	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</><#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> ^Y+^Z
_!BOOMERANG GUIDANCE	-		(AS THE MOVE STARTS) _U/_F/_B/_D
        <#bbbbbb>Holding a direction as the move comes out
        can change the speed and direction of the projectile.</>
_EX TYPHOON DISK		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</><#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _F^Y+^Z
_EX TORNADO TRAP	-		<#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _B^Y+^Z
   <#bbbbbb>Places a trap at the enemy's current location.</>
_EX TYPHOON SHIELD	-		<#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _D^Y+^Z
  <#bbbbbb>A large, invincible reversal. You can only cancel specials into this move
  if the enemy is currently getting hit. Cannot be canceled on block.</>
_EX WHIRLWIND HOVER	-		<#65b5ff>(AIR ONLY)</><#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _D^Y+^Z
   <#bbbbbb>This move allows you to hold any direction to freely
   move Arzon through the air.
   This move does not obey Arzon's FREE AS THE WIND trait.</>







_D	_D		_D

	<#55ffff>SUPERS</>
<#7f7f7f>WIND PALM</>	-		<#55ffff>(2 BARS)</> _D_DF_F_-^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>The projectile moves faster when used in a combo.</>
<#7f7f7f>TYPHOON STRIKE</>	-		<#55ffff>(4 BARS)</> _D_DB_B_-^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>An invincible, powerful, fullscreen barrage.</>

















_D	_D		_D

	UNIVERSAL MOVES
OVERHEAD	-		_F^B
   <#bbbbbb>Puts you in the air and hits overhead.</>
ANTI-AIR	-		_D^C
   <#bbbbbb>This move has invulnerability to projectiles and airborne enemies.</>
GRAB	-		ANY 2 NORMALS </>
   <#bbbbbb>Cannot be blocked. Starts combos on counter-hit.
   Enemies can break this by pressing ^A/^B/^C.</>
FORCE BLOCK (WHILE BLOCKING)	-		<#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _B^X
   <#bbbbbb>Can push the enemy backwards while you block.</>
NO PARRY	-		<#aaffff>(GROUND OR AIR)</><#55ffff>(1 BAR)</> _F^X
   <#bbbbbb>A reversal option that makes you invincible if the enemy hits you.
   Can be used again FOR FREE while the invincibility is active.</>
RECORD SCRATCH (WHILE ATTACKING)		<#55ffff>(1 BAR/2 BARS ON BLOCK)</> ^X
   <#bbbbbb>Can be used to instantly cancel most attacks.
   Holding any direction during this will cause you to move that way.</>
BURST (WHILE GETTING HIT)	-		^X+^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>A large reversal that can be used while you're getting hit.</>
PANIC BURST (WHILE GETTING HIT)	-		<#55ffff>(5 BARS)</> ^X+^A/^B/^C
   <#bbbbbb>An extra burst that can be used in an emergency.</>
   <#ff0000>Using this PERMANENTLY lowers your max meter
   for the rest of the game.</>
